# 🌳 Conditional Chain in LangChain

This project demonstrates how to build **Conditional Chains** using LangChain.

The workflow automatically decides which chain to execute based on the sentiment of user feedback.

---

# 📌 Objective

1. Detect sentiment.
2. If Positive → Generate thank-you response.
3. If Negative → Generate apology/support response.

---

# 🧠 Workflow

```

Feedback
|
v
Sentiment Classifier
|
+------------------------+
| |
Positive Negative
| |
v v
Positive Chain Negative Chain
|
v
Final Response

```

